  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - AIRLINE EXPANSION PLAN, through Government of Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $500,000 Technical Assistance (TA) project assists Eznis Airways LLC (Eznis Airways), a start-up airline business owned by the Mongolian-owned conglomerate Newcom LLC (Newcom), in devising a strategic expansion plan for its commercial aviation business. The TA includes a market assessment of Mongolia&apos;s aviation industry, a study on the technical, economic, financial, legal and regulatory viability of implementing this plan, and the development of a business strategic plan and investment information memorandum. The main goal of the project is to present the investment information memorandum as a comprehensive business strategy to potential investors in order to source financing from equipment leasors, equity investors, commercial banks as well as multilateral financing entities such as the International Finance Corporation (IFC).</narrative>
  </description>
